Question 6

Question: What is the name of the network interface that MTU is set to 1500?

Command used:

ip -o link show

Why this command was used:

The "ip" command is used to display and manage network configuration. The "link show" option displays network interfaces and their properties. The "-o" option displays each interface on one line.

We examined the output and identified the interface with an MTU value of 1500.

Output:

2: ens192: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500

Answer: "ens192"

